  "name": "ACID TEST",
  "what": "Acid techno into acid trance, A minor, 138 BPM. Shows the TB-303: its line alone first, relentless sixteenths with accents and slides through the DRIVE, CUTOFF, RESONANCE, ENV MOD and DECAY turned by commands, a second 303 answering an octave up from side to side; then the DRIVE off for acid trance on Am Am F G: a breakdown (Saw Pad, a sixteenth riff on a pluck, the 303 in a ping-pong DELAY, a snare roll, the Trance Ld's melody) and the drop (Trance Saw chords in the trance gate pumped by DUCK, the riff, the melody on the Super Saw, the 303 a rolling bass)",
